{"seq":1,"slug":"bogle-philosophy","title":"博格尔投资哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/index-fund-theory/bogle-philosophy","wordCount":2242,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"博格尔投资哲学\">博格尔投资哲学</h1><blockquote>\n<p>Vanguard 创始故事、成本拖累长期复合、主动管理零和博弈、&quot;不找针、买草垛&quot;的完整论证。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>博格尔哲学的骨架是一条成本恒等式与一个博弈结论。成本恒等式：投资者所得等于市场收益减去全部成本，而费率是其中唯一可事前确定、可被投资者主动控制的变量，因而在长期复合下成为决定终端财富的隐形杠杆。博弈结论（Sharpe 的主动管理算术）：所有主动投资者作为一个整体，费前等于市场平均收益，费后因承担更高费用必然低于被动持有者。两个结论都不依赖市场是否有效、投资者是否理性，是恒等式而非经验规律。&quot;不找针、买草垛&quot;正是把这两条结论翻译成可执行的操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"约翰-博格尔与-vanguard-的诞生\">约翰·博格尔与 Vanguard 的诞生</h2><p>1974 年，约翰·博格尔（John C. Bogle, 1929–2019）在被 Wellington Management 解雇后创立了 Vanguard Group。这不是一次普通的创业——博格尔设计了一种前所未有的公司治理结构：Vanguard 由其旗下基金共同持有，基金持有人即为公司所有者。这意味着 Vanguard 没有外部股东追求利润最大化，而是以成本价为投资者提供服务。</p>\n<h3 id=\"普林斯顿论文-思想的种子\">普林斯顿论文：思想的种子</h3><p>博格尔的被动投资思想可以追溯到 1951 年他在普林斯顿大学的毕业论文《共同基金行业的经济角色》。在论文中，22 岁的博格尔已经得出一个颠覆性结论：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&quot;基金可能无法声称优于市场平均水平。&quot;</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这一结论在当时几乎无人理睬。直到 1973 年 Burton Malkiel 出版《漫步华尔街》、1964 年 William Sharpe 提出 CAPM 之后，学术界才逐步构建起支撑这一直觉的理论大厦。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第一只指数基金\">第一只指数基金</h3><p>1976 年 8 月 31 日，First Index Investment Trust（后更名为 Vanguard 500 Index Fund）正式发售。初始募集仅 1,130 万美元，远低于目标的 1.5 亿美元。华尔街嘲笑它是&quot;博格尔的蠢事&quot;（Bogle&#39;s Folly），甚至有人称其为&quot;非美国的&quot;（un-American）。</p>\n<p>然而，到 2026 年，Vanguard 管理资产超过 9 万亿美元，Vanguard 500 Index Fund 已成为全球最大的共同基金之一。历史证明了博格尔的判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本拖累-复合效应的隐形杀手\">成本拖累：复合效应的隐形杀手</h2><p>博格尔哲学的数学核心可以用一个简单等式表达：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{investor} = R_{market} - C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{investor}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是投资者实际获得的收益率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{market}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是市场总体收益率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是全部成本（管理费 + 交易成本 + 税收拖累 + 销售费用）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"成本的复合破坏力\">成本的复合破坏力</h3><p>看起来微小的费率差异在长期复合下会产生惊人的影响：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>初始投资</th>\n<th>年化收益</th>\n<th>年费率</th>\n<th>30 年终值</th>\n<th>费率吞噬比例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>10 万元</td>\n<td>8%</td>\n<td>0.1%</td>\n<td>97.1 万元</td>\n<td>3.6%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10 万元</td>\n<td>8%</td>\n<td>1.0%</td>\n<td>76.1 万元</td>\n<td>24.4%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10 万元</td>\n<td>8%</td>\n<td>2.0%</td>\n<td>57.4 万元</td>\n<td>43.0%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>2% 的年费率在 30 年后吞噬了投资者 43% 的终端财富。</strong> 这不是理论推演——中国主动偏股型基金的平均管理费约为 1.2%–1.5%，加上托管费和隐性交易成本，年化总成本轻松超过 2%。</p>\n<h3 id=\"成本的复合公式\">成本的复合公式</h3><p>设年化市场收益为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，年化费率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，投资年限为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>费率侵蚀比例</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>f</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{费率侵蚀比例} = 1 - \\left(\\frac{1+r-f}{1+r}\\right)^n = 1 - \\left(1 - \\frac{f}{1+r}\\right)^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">费率侵蚀比例</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4543em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5043em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4543em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5043em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f \\ll r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 时，近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{nf}{1+r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3355em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，即侵蚀比例近似与年限成正比。<strong>时间越长，费率的破坏力越大。</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[投资 10 万元] --&gt; B{30 年后}&#10;    B --&gt;|费率 0.1%| C[97.1 万元]&#10;    B --&gt;|费率 1.0%| D[76.1 万元]&#10;    B --&gt;|费率 2.0%| E[57.4 万元]\">graph TD\n    A[投资 10 万元] --&gt; B{30 年后}\n    B --&gt;|费率 0.1%| C[97.1 万元]\n    B --&gt;|费率 1.0%| D[76.1 万元]\n    B --&gt;|费率 2.0%| E[57.4 万元]</pre><h2 id=\"主动管理的零和博弈\">主动管理的零和博弈</h2><p>博格尔最具说服力的论证之一是&quot;零和博弈论证&quot;（The Arithmetic of Active Management），这也是 William Sharpe 在 1991 年著名论文中形式化的：</p>\n<h3 id=\"sharpe-的不可辩驳算术\">Sharpe 的不可辩驳算术</h3><p><strong>定理</strong>：在任何给定时间段内，所有投资者（主动+被动）持有的资产总和构成整个市场。因此：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>所有被动投资者获得市场平均收益（费前）</li>\n<li>所有主动投资者的加权平均收益也等于市场平均收益（费前）——因为他们作为一个整体持有&quot;市场组合减去被动投资者持有部分&quot;</li>\n<li>主动投资者平均支付更高费用</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>：费后，主动投资者作为一个整体必然跑输被动投资者。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{R}_{active,\\ after\\ cost} = R_{market} - C_{active} &lt; R_{market} - C_{passive} = \\bar{R}_{passive,\\ after\\ cost}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cos</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ss</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ss</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cos</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这不是经验观察，而是<strong>数学恒等式</strong>。它不依赖市场是否有效，不依赖投资者是否理性——只要主动管理的费用高于被动管理，这个不等式就永远成立。</p>\n<h3 id=\"spiva-数据验证\">SPIVA 数据验证</h3><p>S&amp;P Global 每年发布的 SPIVA（S&amp;P Indices Versus Active）报告持续证实这一理论预测：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>市场</th>\n<th>时间段</th>\n<th>主动基金跑输指数比例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>美国大盘</td>\n<td>15 年</td>\n<td>92.2%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国中盘</td>\n<td>15 年</td>\n<td>95.4%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧洲</td>\n<td>10 年</td>\n<td>87.5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中国 A 股</td>\n<td>5 年</td>\n<td>~70%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>中国市场由于散户比例高、信息不对称大，主动基金的短期胜率略高——但随着市场逐步机构化（2026 年 ETF 持有人超 2600 万户），这一优势正在快速收窄。</p>\n<h3 id=\"幸存者偏差\">幸存者偏差</h3><p>上述数据还受幸存者偏差（survivorship bias）影响：表现最差的基金会被清盘或合并，从统计中消失。如果计入死亡基金，主动管理的实际劣势更大。Vanguard 研究显示，2006–2021 年间美国约 43% 的主动基金被清盘或合并。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不找针-买草垛\">&quot;不找针、买草垛&quot;</h2><p>博格尔最著名的比喻完美概括了被动投资的哲学：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&quot;Don&#39;t look for the needle in the haystack. Just buy the haystack!&quot;（不要在干草垛里找针，买下整个干草垛！）</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这句话的深层含义：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>认知谦逊</strong>：承认自己无法可靠地识别未来的赢家</li>\n<li><strong>成本意识</strong>：搜索&quot;针&quot;的过程本身消耗大量成本（研究费用、交易成本、时间）</li>\n<li><strong>确定性追求</strong>：持有整个市场是唯一确定能获得市场收益的方法</li>\n<li><strong>反脆弱性</strong>：无论哪根针最终表现最好，你都持有它</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"投资哲学的四大支柱\">投资哲学的四大支柱</h3><p>博格尔在其著作《Common Sense on Mutual Funds》中系统阐述了投资哲学的四大支柱：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 博格尔四支柱&#10;        P1[低成本&lt;br/&gt;费率是唯一可预测的回报因子]&#10;        P2[分散化&lt;br/&gt;持有整个市场消除个股风险]&#10;        P3[长期持有&lt;br/&gt;频繁交易是负和博弈]&#10;        P4[简单化&lt;br/&gt;复杂产品主要服务于卖方]&#10;    end&#10;    P1 --&gt; R[长期收益最大化]&#10;    P2 --&gt; R&#10;    P3 --&gt; R&#10;    P4 --&gt; R\">graph TB\n    subgraph 博格尔四支柱\n        P1[低成本&lt;br/&gt;费率是唯一可预测的回报因子]\n        P2[分散化&lt;br/&gt;持有整个市场消除个股风险]\n        P3[长期持有&lt;br/&gt;频繁交易是负和博弈]\n        P4[简单化&lt;br/&gt;复杂产品主要服务于卖方]\n    end\n    P1 --&gt; R[长期收益最大化]\n    P2 --&gt; R\n    P3 --&gt; R\n    P4 --&gt; R</pre><h2 id=\"对博格尔哲学的常见质疑与回应\">对博格尔哲学的常见质疑与回应</h2><h3 id=\"质疑一-中国市场不够有效-主动管理有空间\">质疑一：&quot;中国市场不够有效，主动管理有空间&quot;</h3><p><strong>回应</strong>：零和博弈论证不依赖市场效率。即使市场低效，主动管理者作为一个整体仍然只能获得市场平均收益（费前）。个别投资者可以跑赢，但你需要事前（而非事后）识别他们——而这本身就是一个主动管理问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"质疑二-我可以选到好的基金经理\">质疑二：&quot;我可以选到好的基金经理&quot;</h3><p><strong>回应</strong>：研究表明基金经理业绩几乎没有持续性。Mark Carhart（1997）在控制四因子后发现过去的赢家未来并无显著超额。晨星评级的预测力在控制费率后也大幅下降——即费率本身比星级更能预测未来表现。</p>\n<h3 id=\"质疑三-指数基金在熊市中也会亏钱\">质疑三：&quot;指数基金在熊市中也会亏钱&quot;</h3><p><strong>回应</strong>：正确。被动投资不承诺避免亏损——它承诺你获得市场收益减去最低成本。在熊市中，大多数主动基金同样亏损，且由于费用更高，亏损幅度往往更大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"博格尔遗产-从异端到主流\">博格尔遗产：从异端到主流</h2><p>博格尔于 2019 年去世时，被动投资已从&quot;非美国的&quot;异端邪说变为全球资管行业的主旋律。截至 2026 年：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>全球指数基金和 ETF 总规模超过 35 万亿美元</li>\n<li>美国被动基金规模首次在 2024 年超过主动基金</li>\n<li>中国 ETF 规模从 2019 年的不足 1 万亿元增长到 2026 年的 5 万亿元以上</li>\n<li>Vanguard 的成本引领效应（&quot;Vanguard Effect&quot;）迫使全球资管行业降费</li>\n</ul>\n<p>博格尔的思想影响远不止于投资产品——它重塑了整个金融服务行业的竞争逻辑，从&quot;收取高费用提供神秘的超额收益&quot;转向&quot;以最低成本交付市场回报&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>关键洞见</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成本论</td>\n<td>费率是唯一可确定预测的收益拖累因子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零和博弈</td>\n<td>主动管理者整体费后必然跑输被动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买草垛</td>\n<td>认知谦逊 + 确定性追求 = 持有整个市场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vanguard 结构</td>\n<td>基金持有人即股东，消除利益冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长期复合</td>\n<td>微小费率差异在复合作用下产生巨大终端差异</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博格尔投资哲学","id":"博格尔投资哲学"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"约翰·博格尔与 Vanguard 的诞生","id":"约翰-博格尔与-vanguard-的诞生"},{"level":3,"text":"普林斯顿论文：思想的种子","id":"普林斯顿论文-思想的种子"},{"level":3,"text":"第一只指数基金","id":"第一只指数基金"},{"level":2,"text":"成本拖累：复合效应的隐形杀手","id":"成本拖累-复合效应的隐形杀手"},{"level":3,"text":"成本的复合破坏力","id":"成本的复合破坏力"},{"level":3,"text":"成本的复合公式","id":"成本的复合公式"},{"level":2,"text":"主动管理的零和博弈","id":"主动管理的零和博弈"},{"level":3,"text":"Sharpe 的不可辩驳算术","id":"sharpe-的不可辩驳算术"},{"level":3,"text":"SPIVA 数据验证","id":"spiva-数据验证"},{"level":3,"text":"幸存者偏差","id":"幸存者偏差"},{"level":2,"text":"\"不找针、买草垛\"","id":"不找针-买草垛"},{"level":3,"text":"投资哲学的四大支柱","id":"投资哲学的四大支柱"},{"level":2,"text":"对博格尔哲学的常见质疑与回应","id":"对博格尔哲学的常见质疑与回应"},{"level":3,"text":"质疑一：\"中国市场不够有效，主动管理有空间\"","id":"质疑一-中国市场不够有效-主动管理有空间"},{"level":3,"text":"质疑二：\"我可以选到好的基金经理\"","id":"质疑二-我可以选到好的基金经理"},{"level":3,"text":"质疑三：\"指数基金在熊市中也会亏钱\"","id":"质疑三-指数基金在熊市中也会亏钱"},{"level":2,"text":"博格尔遗产：从异端到主流","id":"博格尔遗产-从异端到主流"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"市值加权与替代加权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/index-fund-theory/market-cap-weighting"}}